{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13107100","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13107100","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1310710001:1":{"text":"神魔大戦の時、この地の人たちは、ラズベリーを包んだ雪玉を投げ合い、崩れた雪玉と赤いベリーをカタストロフの頭部に見立てていました。","source_cn":"据说神魔战争时，这儿的人会用雪球包裹着树莓互相投掷，以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF78BAB59127E6BD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310710002:1":{"text":"強大な敵に対抗する術のない一般人は、こうした形でカタストロフへの憎しみを現していたのです。","source_cn":"毕竟，普通人的力量远远无法与恶魔对抗，只能用这种方式来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C69C5CD7F042B71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310710003:1":{"text":"その後、デューラ様がかの女将軍を導き、人々は戦いに勝利しました。","source_cn":"后来女神艾雅引领那位伟大的女将军，人们终于战胜了恶魔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BEA5DB5410C964F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310710004:1":{"text":"ですが雪玉を投げる遊びは今もこうして残っているのです。","source_cn":"但这个投掷雪球的小游戏就这么保留了下来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DEDB45C5E82D7A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祭典办事员":{"text":"祭典のスタッフ","source":"祭典办事员","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}